# wear/woman/rags_hang: the shift's torn skirt to the knee: worn folds, the hem in ragged teeth and tatters (each tooth its own
# outline); her bare shins and feet below; it sways by whole rows, swings wide on the stride, streams back in the run
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# The motion rebuild (2026-10-21, docs/MOTION_P2.md 7.3): the run's flare tatters lift clear of the kicked shin and fly
# back over the trailing thigh; the man's side `wide` views ride the pivot (his down frames drop the hip, the hem holds its
# row; a `when elf` twin a row up).
# WOMAN-WEAR (P2B rollout, 2026-10-22): the run `flare` trails the leaned torso (front level with the torso's hem front,
# each row lower a pixel further back, never reaching far behind: B10), covering whole leg rows (B11 HIPW, SLIVER); long
# skirts' walk `wide` hem rows swing a whole pixel forward on the contact and pass (rest on the reach): no glide.
use person woman
body woman
role garment rags
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 3

